        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Feodor Chin, David Huynh, Stephane Gauger\n- Companies: Blizzard Entertainment, Activision Blizzard\n- Products: Overwatch, Chinatown Squad\n- Places: Irvine, California, San Francisco Chinatown\n- Roles: Zenyatta, Fong, Pistol Pete\n\nFacts:\n- Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. is an American video game developer and publisher based in Irvine, California.\n- Blizzard Entertainment is a subsidiary of the American company Activision Blizzard.\n- Feodor Chin voices Zenyatta in Blizzard Entertainment's game Overwatch.\n- Chinatown Squad is a pilot about San Francisco Chinatown in the 1890s.\n- Stephane Gauger directed and produced Chinatown Squad.\n- Feodor Chin wrote Chinatown Squad and stars in it as the antagonist Pistol Pete.\n- David Huynh appears in Chinatown Squad as the protagonist Fong.",
